<title>POLAND: ELEKTROBUDOWA NET FALLS IN JULY.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROBUDOWA NET FALLS IN JULY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.13 vs   2.04</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.70 vs   3.25</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.00 vs   3.51</p>
<p> Sales		   16.82 vs  17.18</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     9.46 vs   9.91</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	14.24 vs  16.95</p>
<p> Operating profit    14.94 vs  18.10</p>
<p> Sales		  133.80 vs 123.96</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Elektrobudowa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
